<title>USA: St. Joe OK's $10/share distribution.</title>
<headline>St. Joe OK's $10/share distribution.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>St. Joe Corp said on Wednesday it approved a distribution in partial liquidation of $10 per share to holders of record on March 21, payable on March 31.</p>
<p>The distribution is from the net proceeds from the sales of various assets in 1996. The remaining net proceeds -- about $1 per share -- are expected to be distributed later this year, the company said.</p>
<p>St. Joe also declared an unchanged quarterly dividend of $0.05 per share, payable on March 31 to holders as of March 21.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
